<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pagamento Pix - SAMP</title>
    <style>
        body { background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #2c3e50 0%, #000 100%); color: white; font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh; margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
        
        .payment-wrapper { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 30px; }
        
        /* O Cartão de Pagamento */
        .payment-card { 
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); 
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px); 
            width: 450px; 
            padding: 40px; 
            border-radius: 30px; 
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); 
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); 
            text-align: center; 
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

        .payment-card h2 { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: #f1c40f; }
        .payment-card p { color: #bbb; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 30px; }

        /* Área do QR Code */
        .qr-container { 
            background: white; 
            padding: 15px; 
            border-radius: 20px; 
            display: inline-block; 
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(241, 196, 15, 0.3);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .qr-container:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }
        .qr-code { width: 200px; height: 200px; display: block; }

        .payment-info { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .payment-info b { color: #f1c40f; font-size: 20px; }

        .btn-back { 
            background: transparent; 
            color: #aaa; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            font-size: 14px; 
            border: 1px solid #444; 
            padding: 10px 20px; 
            border-radius: 10px; 
            transition: 0.3s; 
        }
        .btn-back:hover { color: white; border-color: white; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="payment-wrapper">
        <div class="payment-card">
            <h2>Confirmação de Compra</h2>
            <p>Seu pedido de <b><%= cashAmount %> moedas</b> foi gerado.</p>
            
            <div class="payment-info">
                Valor a pagar: <b>R$ <%= (cashAmount/1000).toFixed(2) %></b>
            </div>

            <div class="qr-container">
                <!-- QR Code Gerado via API para ser real e bonito -->
                <img class="qr-code" src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=200x200&data=SAMP_PIX_<%= cashAmount %>" alt="QR Code Pix">
            </div>

            <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                Escaneie o código acima com seu app do banco.<br>
                O saldo cairá automaticamente após a aprovação.
            </p>

            <a href="/shop" class="btn-back">← Voltar para a Loja</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
